<title>GERMANY: BMW sees stable sales of BMW cars in 1997.</title>
<headline>BMW sees stable sales of BMW cars in 1997.</headline>
<dateline>MUNICH, Germany 1997-01-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>German luxury car maker Bayerische Motoren Werke (BMW) said on Thursday that it expects stable sales for BMW brand cars this year and aims to boost produtivity and earnings.</p>
<p>The company, which is the parent of Rover Group, also said that in coming years it plans to launch at least two completely new products a year.</p>
</text>
